<title>HONG KONG: World Houseware 9-months net HK$35.7 mln.</title>
<headline>World Houseware 9-months net HK$35.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.7    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    35.65  vs 6.18</p>
<p>    Turnover		     602.49 vs 643.48</p>
<p>    Company name		 World Houseware (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 19-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 15</p>
<p>NOTE - World Houseware is a maker of PVC and fabric household products.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to December 31 from March 31. Comparative figures are for April 1, 1995 to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for nine months is 1.5 H.K. cents vs 1.2 cents (for year).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
